---
// Benefits.astro
---
<section id="benefits" class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
  {/* Subtle tri-color ambient glows */}
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-brand-primary/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-[250px] h-[250px] bg-brand-orange/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 w-[300px] h-[200px] bg-brand-green/10 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">

    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-brand-orange font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm mb-3">The Psychology of Conversion</h2>
      <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-6">How we ethically hack your customers' brains.</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-muted">We don't guess. We use data-backed behavioral design to guide visitors exactly where we want them: your booking calendar.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      {/* Benefit 1 — Blue (Primary) */}
      <div class="glass-card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-primary/20 hover:border-brand-primary/50 transition-colors duration-300">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-primary/15 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-primary/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-primary" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 01-9 9m9-9a9 9 0 00-9-9m9 9H3m9 9a9 9 0 01-9-9m9 9c1.657 0 3-4.03 3-9s-1.343-9-3-9m0 18c-1.657 0-3-4.03-3-9s1.343-9 3-9m-9 9a9 9 0 019-9" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">The "Halo Effect"</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
          People judge your entire business competence by your website in 0.05 seconds. We create a premium, authoritative design that makes your competitors look cheap.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Benefit 2 — Green (Growth) */}
      <div class="glass-card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-green/20 hover:border-brand-green/50 transition-colors duration-300" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-green/15 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-green/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-green" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7h8m0 0v8m0-8l-8 8-4-4-6 6" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Frictionless Dopamine Loops</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
          Confused minds don't buy. We strip away distractions and use micro-commitments to make contacting you feel natural, inevitable, and rewarding.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Benefit 3 — Orange (Urgency) */}
      <div class="glass-card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-orange/20 hover:border-brand-orange/50 transition-colors duration-300" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-orange/15 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-orange/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-brand-orange" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 18h.01M8 21h8a2 2 0 002-2V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H8a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-white mb-3">Dominance & Market Capture</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
          When someone searches for a local service, they have high buying intent. We optimize for speed and search to capture them before they ever see the other guys.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
